ized personnel (e.g., Security, IT, HR, Legal, and \\n\\nmanagement with a need to know) and is subject to confidentiality and auditing requirements. \\n\\n##  Jurisdiction and Compliance \\n\\n\\\\-  Monitoring activities will comply with applicable laws, including but not limited to U.S. state privacy \\n\\nand wiretap/consent laws, CPRA, and GDPR where applicable. Where required, jurisdiction\u2011specific notices or \\n\\nconsents will be obtained. \\n\\n\\\\-  In the event of a conflict between this policy and local law, local law controls. \\n\\n##  Employee Responsibilities \\n\\n\\\\-  Use Company systems and data responsibly and in accordance with Company policies. \\n\\n\\\\-  Do not attempt to disable, evade, or tamper with monitoring or security controls. \\n\\n##  Questions and Appeals \\n\\nEmployees with questions or concerns, or who wish to challenge the accuracy of monitoring data, should \\n\\ncontact HR or the Information Security team. The Company will review and address inquiries in a timely \\n\\nmanner. \\n\\n##  Violations and Discipline \\n\\nViolations of this policy or attempts to circumvent monitoring or security controls may result in \\n\\ncorrective action, up to and including termination, subject to local laws and applicable collective \\n\\nagreements. \\n\\n##  Transparency Commitment \\n\\nThe Company will maintain an internal page listing the primary monitoring and security tools in use and \\n\\nwill notify employees before material changes when feasible. Monitoring is a condition of using Company \\n\\nsystems and accessing Company data.ssssssssssss \\n\\nXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX \\n\\n  * Upload \\n  * Folder \\n  * Text file \\n  * Document \\n  * Spreadsheet \\n  * Presentation \\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=//Documents&fileid=135#editor', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', error=True, observation='browse', goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls